## Biome Config After Migration

```json
{
	"linter": {
		"rules": {
			"preset": "none",
			"nursery": {
				"useConsistentBlockLang": {
					"level": "warn",
					"options": {
						"blocks": { "script": { "lang": ["js"], "allowNoLang": true } }
					}
				}
			}
		}
	}
}

